WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:10.030
This riddle is presented to us in the form
of an image and we need to find the height

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.400
of the table-stand.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:17.760
It’s adapted from a problem asked to elementary
school students in China!

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:22.380
The same three things are given to us in two
different situations.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:27.820
In the first situation, the cat is on the
stand and the dog is resting on the floor.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:34.649
The distance from the dog's back to the cat's
head is one hundred and fifty centimetres.

00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:39.260
In the second situation, the dog is on the
stand and the cat is on the floor.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:45.740
And the distance from the cat's head to the
dog's back is one hundred and twenty centimetres.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:51.520
With this given information, how will you
find the height of the stand?

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:56.040
There are TWO ways to solve this riddle!

00:00:56.040 --> 00:01:01.210
But before we analyse this riddle, I want
to give you some good news!

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:07.610
2 lucky winners stand a chance to win giveaways
from us and there are clues in the video which

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:10.490
will help you qualify for the giveaways!

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:12.210
Keep watching!

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:17.899
This riddle video and the giveaways are made
possible because of Puzzle Master, which is

00:01:17.899 --> 00:01:24.979
